NOTE ON THE DATASET

The patches under dataset/ are a class-balanced binary subset of DiagSet
(Koziarski et al., Sci. Rep. 14:6780, 2024), redistributed here for
reproducibility. They are covered by the licence of the original DiagSet
release, not by the MIT licence above. Cite the original work if you use them:

  M. Koziarski, B. Cyganek, P. Niedziela, et al. DiagSet: a dataset for
  prostate cancer histopathological image classification.
  Scientific Reports 14, 6780 (2024). https://doi.org/10.1038/s41598-024-52183-4
